# Compiled output (tsc outDir). ANCHORED with a leading slash: a bare `lib/`
# matches at ANY depth, which silently untracked the 28 shared helpers in
# `src/lib/` (paths, guards, notifications, ...) and left a fresh clone unable to
# build the Functions. Only the build output at the functions root is ignored.
/lib/

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Firebase / local config and secrets (never commit)
*.local
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
serviceAccount*.json
ui-debug.log
firebase-debug.log
database-debug.log
firestore-debug.log
pubsub-debug.log
